  "label": "User projected onto the dehumanizing text overlay",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the textual material that dehumanizes Palestinians, as the meme's intent is to incite hatred and dehumanization by directly addressing the viewer with hateful rhetoric. The text 'palestinians are not human beings, they don't deserve to live and they are nothing but animals' is presented as a direct statement to the viewer, making the user the implicit recipient of this dehumanizing message. There are no explicit deictic pronouns like 'you' or 'me', but the rhetorical force and hateful intent of the text create a direct projection onto the viewer, who is expected to internalize or be confronted with the message.",
